1790173843	target	F17 does not census `Record`: it searched for `(struct|enum) Record\b|Record \{|verify::Record` — a census must search for the symbol itself, byte for byte
a census is one search of the whole worktree for the symbol itself:
    tetel look --grep Record <worktree root>
    tetel fact --note "..."
then cite that fact. The refusal is about the search's existence and where it was rooted, never about what it found.
